  "content_html": "<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/418f56abc640a0f997.png\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"410\" data-original-width=\"449\" height=\"183\" src=\"/assets/images/content/418f56abc640a0f997.png\" width=\"200\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><h2 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc; font-family: arial;\">🕯️ מעט מן האור</span></h2><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><p style=\"background-color: white; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">תוֹכָחָה מְסֻתֶּרֶת<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אַהֲבָה גְּלוּיָה<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">- כְּרֹעֶה יְנַהֵל עֶדְרוֹ.</span></p><p style=\"background-color: white; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">חִלּוּף מִשְׁמֶרֶת<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">דִמְדּוּמֵי שְׁקִיעָה,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">טְלָאִים</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">יְקַבֵּץ בְּחֵיקוֹ.</span></p><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">📘 עצה שבועית</span></h2><p style=\"background-color: white; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כשאדם נפרד - תקשיב עד הסוף.<br data-end=\"172\" data-start=\"169\" />לפעמים הדברים הכי חשובים נאמרים בשקט,<br data-end=\"214\" data-start=\"211\" /></span></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; background-color: white; border: 0px; box-sizing: inherit; direction: rtl; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לא מתוך סמכות, אלא מתוך לב.</span></span></p><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">🌀 הצד השני של המטבע</span></h2><p style=\"background-color: white; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"></span></p><div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">\"אֵין מוֹכִיחִין אֶת הָאָדָם אֶלָּא סָמוּךְ לַמִּיתָה\"</span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">💎 פנינה</span></h2><p style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">\"דברים\" = 256 = \"אלהים עמכם\"</p><p style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">לפעמים מילה אחת - נושאת נוכחות שלמה</p><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">📘 מילון ארמי־עברי</span></h2><p style=\"background-color: white; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><i>חמש מילים מארמית שבתורה - עם פענוח והארה לשונית.</i></span></p><p style=\"background-color: white; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"></p><ol style=\"background-color: white; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">'דְּבָרִים' / 'פִּתְגָמַיָּא'<br /><span style=\"color: #666666;\">❖דיבורים,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: #666666;\">אמירות - פתגמים</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">'בָּעֵת' / 'בְּעִדָּנָא'<br /><span style=\"color: #666666;\">❖בִּזְמַן - עידן השפע.</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">'תִּירָא' / 'תִּדְחַל'<br /><span style=\"color: #666666;\">❖תפחד, דחליל מפחיד ציפורים</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">'דֶּרֶךְ' / 'אוֹרְחָא'<br /><span style=\"color: #666666;\">❖שביל, מעבר - עובר אורח.</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">'מָקוֹם' / 'אֲתַר'<br /><span style=\"color: #666666;\">❖אזור מסוים - אתר בניה/אינטרנט</span></span></li></ol></span></div></span></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: right;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">👁️ מבט חד</span><br /></h2><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: right;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/54c5ebdd0257a774d3.png\" style=\"background-color: white; margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1024\" data-original-width=\"1024\" height=\"158\" src=\"/assets/images/content/54c5ebdd0257a774d3.png\" width=\"158\" /></a></div><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">רַב לָכֶם שֶׁבֶת בָּהָר הַזֶּה.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">פְּנוּ וּסְעוּ לָכֶם</span></span></span></div></div></div>"
